---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="SleepSync - Der Biohack für deinen Schlaf">
  <div class="app-header">
     <a href="/" class="back-link">← Zurück</a>

     <h1>SleepSync</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Kein gewöhnlicher Wecker. <br>Dein wissenschaftlicher Schlaf-Algorithmus.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="app-content">
    
    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>Der Rhythmus macht den Unterschied</h2>
      <p>
        Wachst du oft gerädert auf, obwohl du lange geschlafen hast? Das liegt an der <strong>Sleep Inertia</strong>. 
        SleepSync berechnet deine Schlafenszeit basierend auf wissenschaftlichen <strong>90-Minuten-Zyklen</strong>. 
        Wir wecken dich nicht, wenn du schläfst – wir sagen dir, wann du ins Bett gehen musst, um perfekt aufzuwachen.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>Funktionen</h2>
      <ul class="features-list">
        <li><span class="feature-icon">🧬</span><span class="feature-title"><strong>Ultradiane Zyklen:</strong></span><span class="feature-desc">Berechnung der optimalen Bettzeit (4, 5 oder 6 Zyklen).</span></li>
        <li><span class="feature-icon">📉</span><span class="feature-title"><strong>5-Minuten-Shift:</strong></span><span class="feature-desc">Ein intelligenter Algorithmus, der deine Bettzeit sanft anpasst, bis du deinen Sweet-Spot gefunden hast.</span></li>
        <li><span class="feature-icon">📝</span><span class="feature-title"><strong>Morgen-Journal:</strong></span><span class="feature-desc">Bewerte deine Energie und tracke Faktoren wie Koffein oder Sport.</span></li>
        <li><span class="feature-icon">🌑</span><span class="feature-title"><strong>Melatonin-Safe:</strong></span><span class="feature-desc">Ein komplett dunkles "OLED-friendly" Design, das dich abends nicht wach hält.</span></li>
        <li><span class="feature-icon">🧠</span><span class="feature-title"><strong>Daily Knowledge:</strong></span><span class="feature-desc">Lerne jeden Tag einen neuen wissenschaftlichen Fakt über Schlaf.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="app-section">
      <h2>Warum SleepSync?</h2>
      <p>
        Die meisten Apps wollen deine Daten verkaufen oder nerven mit Abos. SleepSync ist anders.
      </p>
      <ul class="benefits-list">
        <li><span class="feature-icon">🔒</span><span class="feature-title"><strong>100% Privat:</strong></span><span class="feature-desc">Alle Daten bleiben lokal auf deinem Gerät (Hive Database).</span></li>
        <li><span class="feature-icon">🚫</span><span class="feature-title"><strong>Kein Abo:</strong></span><span class="feature-desc">Nutze alle Features kostenlos.</span></li>
        <li><span class="feature-icon">🔋</span><span class="feature-title"><strong>Akku-Schonend:</strong></span><span class="feature-desc">Kein nächtliches Mikrofon- oder Sensor-Tracking.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-section">
      <h2>Unterstütze das Projekt</h2>
      <p>
        SleepSync ist "Donationware". Wenn dir die App hilft, deinen Rhythmus zu finden, 
        freue ich mich über einen virtuellen Kaffee. Das hält die Entwicklung am Laufen!
      </p>
      <div class="button-group">
        <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/fehlstartapps" target="_blank" class="cta-button primary">
          Einen Kaffee spendieren ☕
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="small-print">Verfügbar für Android (Sideload) & bald iOS.</p>
    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  :root { --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #2dd4bf, #818cf8); --accent-glow: rgba(45,212,191,0.14); --text-muted: #9ca3af; --card-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }

  .app-header { text-align:center; padding:3.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem; max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto 1rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.75rem; align-items:center; }

  .back-link { color:#818cf8; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; align-self:flex-start; transition: color 200ms ease; }

  .back-link:hover { color: #2dd4bf; }

  /* icons removed from header */

  .app-header h1 { font-size:3rem; font-weight:800; margin:0; background:var(--primary-gradient); -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; }

  .tagline { color:var(--text-muted); max-width:64ch; text-align:center; }

  .app-content { max-width:880px; margin:0 auto; padding:2rem 1.5rem 4rem; display:grid; gap:1.25rem; }

  .app-section { padding:1.25rem; background:var(--card-bg); border-radius:14px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.45); }

  .app-section h2 { font-size:1.4rem; color:#fff; margin-bottom:0.75rem; }

  .app-section p { color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.75; }

  .features-list, .benefits-list { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; display:grid; gap:0.75rem; }

  .features-list li, .benefits-list li { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto minmax(160px, auto) 1fr; gap:0.4rem 0.8rem; align-items:baseline; padding:1.25rem 1.5rem; border-radius:12px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01); transition:all 200ms ease; }

  .features-list li:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6); }

  .feature-icon { font-size:1.2rem; }

  .feature-title { }

  .feature-title strong { color: #2dd4bf; }

  .feature-desc { color:var(--text-muted); }

  .cta-section { text-align:center; padding:2.5rem 2rem 1.5rem 2rem; border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), rgba(255,255,255,0.00)); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }

  .button-group { display:flex; gap:1rem; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:1.5rem 0; }

  .cta-button { display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; border-radius:12px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; transition:all 200ms ease; border:2px solid transparent; }

  .cta-button.primary { background:var(--primary-gradient); color:#000; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(45,212,191,0.12); }

  .cta-button.primary:hover { transform:translateY(-4px); box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(45,212,191,0.25); }

  .cta-button.secondary { background:transparent; color:#818cf8; border:2px solid rgba(129,140,248,0.5); }

  .cta-button.secondary:hover { background:rgba(129,140,248,0.1); border-color:rgba(129,140,248,0.8); transform:translateY(-2px); }

  .small-print { margin-top:1rem; color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem; }

  @media (max-width:720px){ .app-header h1{ font-size:2.2rem } }
</style>